# alt_inflight_switch.scn — in-flight switch INTO ALT_HOLD + re-center gate (Case B)
#                          飛行中の ALT_HOLD 進入＋再センターゲート（Case B）  (new 2026-06-14)
#
# Spec under test (2026-06-14 redesign — Case B of the re-center gate):
#   The craft auto-takes-off in ALT_HOLD to 0.5 m (deterministic start), drops to
#   STABILIZE briefly (manual throttle ≈ hover, holding ~0.5 m), then flips BACK to
#   ALT_HOLD with the throttle OFF-CENTER. On that STABILIZE→ALT_HOLD switch the
#   controller captures the current altitude AND closes the re-center gate, so the
#   off-center throttle does NOT jump the altitude — it HOLDS. Re-centering (3072)
#   opens the gate; pushing up (4095) then climbs.
#     F [15.0,17.0]: gate CLOSED by the switch → throttle 3330 (norm 0.63) is IGNORED,
#                    altitude holds ~0.5 m. Without the gate it would climb ~0.13 m/s.
#     H [20.5,21.5]: after re-centering at G the gate OPENS, so 4095 (full up) climbs.
#
# 検証する仕様（2026-06-14 再設計 — 再センターゲートの Case B）:
#   ALT_HOLD で 0.5 m へ自動離陸（決定論的な起点）→ 一瞬 STABILIZE（手動スロットル≈ホバーで
#   ~0.5 m 保持）→ スロットルを中央から外したまま ALT_HOLD へ戻す。その STABILIZE→ALT_HOLD
#   切替で制御器が現在高度を捕捉し再センターゲートを閉じるため、中央外スロットルは高度を
#   ジャンプさせず保持する。中央復帰(3072)でゲートが開き、上げ(4095)で上昇する。
#
# Throttle normalization: (raw-2048)/2048 → 2048=0.0, 3072=0.5(hover/hold), 4095=1.0.
#
# Run: sf sil scenario simulator/sil/scenarios/alt_inflight_switch.scn --target vehicle_new
#
#  <t>  ch  <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt> <acro> <pos>
   0    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # A: boot at rest — still calibration completes (~4 s)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1500      50        1              # B: ALT switch ON while DISARMED → ground mode change
   +    rc   3072  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50        1              # C: ARM in ALT_HOLD — props stop, spool, AUTO-takeoff fires
   +    rc   3072  2048   2048    2048  1     3500      50        1              # D: throttle CENTER → climb to 0.5 m and settle
   +    rc   3330  2048   2048    2048  1     1500      50        0              # E: switch to STABILIZE, throttle UP → brief manual climb
   +    rc   3330  2048   2048    2048  1     5500      50        1              # F: flip BACK to ALT_HOLD, throttle OFF-CENTER → gate CLOSED → capture+HOLD (no re-climb)
   +    rc   3072  2048   2048    2048  1     1500      50        1              # G: throttle to CENTER (3072) → gate OPENS
   +    rc   4095  2048   2048    2048  1     3000      50        1              # H: throttle FULL UP → gate OPEN → climb
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     200       50                       # I: release ARM button
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     200       50                       # J: press again → DISARM (toggle)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     600       50                       # K: settle disarmed
